{
  "title": "Unique Slow-Cooked Australian Swede Casserole",
  "description": "A charred, light, and adventurous Australian dish featuring swede, this casserole is perfect for a unique dinner experience, and is FODMAP-friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Australian",
  "diet": [
    "gluten-free",
    "low-fodmap"
